        "promptText": "Create one continuous 15-second handheld European travel-diary clip following the same fictional adult traveller through five connected moments: leaving a quiet railway platform at dawn, crossing a rain-bright old-town lane, tasting an unbranded pastry at a small café counter, watching sea light from a ferry deck, and ending beneath warm evening street lamps. Use motivated match movement instead of abrupt montage cuts, keep the traveller's face, olive field jacket, canvas bag and proportions stable, and preserve plausible geography, weather progression, exposure and background motion. Natural gestures, restrained lens breathing, documentary ambience and polished 16:9 colour. No public likeness, brands, readable signs, dialogue, subtitles, watermarks, duplicate bodies, morphing or unsafe behaviour.",
